{
  "date": "2026-11-05",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "人行厦门市分行：数字人民币落地四项新业务，两项全国第一",
  "title_en": "PBOC Xiamen branch: four new digital yuan businesses launched, two are national firsts",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "中国人民银行厦门市分行在11月4日举行了2026年的第三次新闻发布会。",
      "en": "The People's Bank of China Xiamen branch held its third press conference of 2026 on November 4."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这家分行和另外六个部门一起发布了一份文件，目的是推动厦门的数字金融发展。数字人民币是中国人民银行发行的数字货币。",
      "en": "This branch and six other departments jointly issued a document aimed at promoting the development of digital finance in Xiamen. The digital yuan is a digital currency issued by the People's Bank of China."
    },
    {
      "zh": "按照这份文件，厦门已经落地了四项数字人民币业务。其中有两项是全国第一：第一笔“词元出海”的数字人民币跨境结算，以及第一只使用数字人民币的绿色金融债券。",
      "en": "Under this document, Xiamen has already launched four digital yuan businesses. Two of them are firsts in the country: the first digital yuan cross-border settlement for \"token going overseas\" (词元出海), and the first digital yuan green financial bond."
    },
    {
      "zh": "另外两项是全省第一：第一次用数字人民币发放农民工工资，以及第一笔“数币达”跨境业务。",
      "en": "The other two are firsts in the province: the first time digital yuan was used to pay migrant workers' wages, and the first cross-border business through \"Shubida\" (数币达)."
    }
  ],
